### Get all leave requests
GET http://localhost:8080/leaves

### Get a leave request by id
GET http://localhost:8080/leaves/1

### Create a leave request
POST http://localhost:8080/leaves
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "EMP-100",
  "leaveType": "SICK",
  "startDate": "2026-10-12",
  "endDate": "2026-10-13",
  "reason": "Flu"
}

### Update a leave request
PUT http://localhost:8080/leaves/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "EMP-001",
  "leaveType": "CASUAL",
  "startDate": "2026-10-02",
  "endDate": "2026-10-03",
  "reason": "Family function",
  "status": "APPROVED"
}

### Delete a leave request
DELETE http://localhost:8080/leaves/1

### Validation error (missing fields)
POST http://localhost:8080/leaves
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Not found
GET http://localhost:8080/leaves/999
